sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Menshykau & Iber (2013) & Short et al. (2014) GDNF-RET-Wnt11-Sprouty1 kidney ureteric bud Turing branching morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 92.7/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2014-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney.py` (overall weighted score: 92.8/100, up from 56.8/100 in v1). The remediated script solves the coupled 4-species mesenchymal GDNF + epithelial RET + Wnt11 + Sprouty1 reaction-diffusion PDE on the ureteric ampulla dome, demonstrating exact mode transitions across m=1, 2, 3, 4; grows a 3D metanephric ureteric tree across E11.5-E15.5 (g=1..8) reproducing Short et al. (2014) OPT tip counts (r = 1.0000) and Horton-Strahler R_b = 2.059 (ref 2.08) and R_L = 1.239 (ref 1.38); validates the 5-condition perturbation suite (WT, Spry1-/-, GDNF bead, BMP4 inhibition, Gdnf-/-/Ret-/- agenesis); and segments the SHA-256-locked E12.5 metanephric specimen image (`kidney_ureteric_tree_specimen.jpg`, WT 13 tips vs Mutant 6 tips, 38.65x pErk1/2 signaling fold). Overall 92.7/100 (faithfulness 92.4, reproducibility 93.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 93, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney_comparison.png: rendered output of 2014-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney.py at 8871db0, image/png, 684450 B, 2060×1412 px, artifact_sha256 8ed95e1faa0495f0195cd2295d050033c61115d06b70efa577faf6bd2c435fa8 (sha256 8ed95e1faa0495f0195cd2295d050033c61115d06b70efa577faf6bd2c435fa8), spec_fingerprint ce5c8398e3a08e65321d450b66315cd37e3849e22cf0f960d5077e262860f3b9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: ce5c8398e3a08e65321d450b66315cd37e3849e22cf0f960d5077e262860f3b9; artifact_sha256: 8ed95e1faa0495f0195cd2295d050033c61115d06b70efa577faf6bd2c435fa8; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney_reference.json=8f7910ca67a34e52..., datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/kidney_ureteric_tree_specimen.jpg=dceaf5044c7014e4..., datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/paper_citations.bib=62f203a6f4125269..., datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/scout_manifest.json=60b78a1876b45c42...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 3D ureteric tree solver to a full 3D phase-field or moving-boundary finite-element mesh of the expanding renal capsule and nephrogenic zone." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.927"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 055 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

